  "description": "Sunny Honey is a cute and cheerful handwritten script font designed to bring a warm and joyful feel to your creative projects. With its soft curves and slightly bouncy letterforms, this font creates a natural handwritten look while maintaining excellent readability.\nThoughtfully crafted for versatility, Sunny Honey works beautifully across a wide range of applications—from Cricut cutting projects to digital planners, branding, and social media design. Its smooth and clean strokes ensure consistent results for both writing and cutting, making it perfect for everyday creative use.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Sunny Honey is a cute and cheerful handwritten script font designed to bring a warm and joyful feel to your creative projects. With its soft curves and slightly bouncy letterforms, this font creates a natural handwritten look while maintaining excellent readability.</p>\n<p>Thoughtfully crafted for versatility, Sunny Honey works beautifully across a wide range of applications—from Cricut cutting projects to digital planners, branding, and social media design. Its smooth and clean strokes ensure consistent results for both writing and cutting, making it perfect for everyday creative use.</p>",
